        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — first version with automatic updates.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>One place for everything.</strong> Big artwork, playback controls and volume for whatever is playing, with a switcher when more than one thing plays.</li>
<li><strong>Group speakers.</strong> Open Speakers to choose which HomePods play together, each with its own volume.</li>
<li><strong>Mini player.</strong> A small floating player you can show or hide from the header button or by right-clicking the menu bar icon.</li>
<li><strong>Automatic updates.</strong> New versions install themselves; check anytime with Check for Updates… in the right-click menu.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
